    "message": "Update MainActivity.kt",
    "created_at": "2026-08-24T01:38:02Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/FCL-Team/FoldCraftLauncher/actions/runs/32680421308"
  },
  {
    "id": 32635112259,
    "sha": "d0985cd8996f858c3ea9c9df4a00fa3e3afb0498",
    "short_sha": "d0985cd",
    "message": "refactor: 移除 FCLPath.CONTEXT，全局 Context 改用 FCLApp.getAppContext()/getActivity()\n\nFCLApplication 更名 FCLApp，getCurrentActivity 更名 getActivity，\n新增 getAppContext()（attachBaseContext 赋值，@NotNull 契约）。\n\n- 弹窗场景（控制器升级/不兼容提示、账号登录）改取当前 Activity\n  并加 isDestroyed/isFinishing 守卫，修复异步投递期间 Activity\n  销毁导致的 BadTokenException 崩溃\n- FCLBridge 剪贴板/打开链接消除 (Activity) 强转，改为 getActivity 判空\n- 其余 13 处 CONTEXT 读取改用 getAppContext，类加载期/构造期\n  不再依赖 loadPaths 时序（Curse 密钥、WorldInfo 维度名、\n  VersionSetting 内存默认值等）\n- ThemeData 消除完全限定名；AndroidUtil.copyFile 参数改 Context",
    "created_at": "2026-08-23T10:55:32Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/FCL-Team/FoldCraftLauncher/actions/runs/32635112259"
  },
  {
    "id": 32632834841,
    "sha": "b645ac664bdcffd24927331a16b865a291ae419d",
    "short_sha": "b645ac6",
    "message": "refactor: getLocalizedText 静态 key 迁移至 R.string\n\n静态 key 调用改为 context.getString(R.string.xxx)，编译期校验资源存在；修复 fabric-api 连字符 key、world.export.wizard 点号 key 两个长期未命中的本地化；补 modpack_type_hmcl 九语言翻译。动态 key（curse_category/枚举拼接）保留 getLocalizedText 机制",
    "created_at": "2026-08-23T10:03:49Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/FCL-Team/FoldCraftLauncher/actions/runs/32632834841"
  },
